{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"身体先松、念头和警觉滞后的心理过程直接接续H8、H12和H14，并将安宁限定为真实但不能保证未来的短暂状态，没有新增事件或把音乐变化当成心理原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"从克制和努力无法换来确定，到催逼暂退后能够不靠解释或证明来承认在乎，接续了H4、H5、H6、H19和H20；祈求被明确处理为内在愿望的感受，而非新增的实际对象、身份或外部事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"远方家园感只是听感比喻，解释则将H3中无法恢复原样的过去、H10中当下仍能发生的快乐与H15、H17中的怀念和舍不得连成局部心理过程，没有虚构真实的家园往事或改变主线。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"安静中更直接地感到亲近正在过去、因想留住而急迫、再因持续加力无效而耗竭，分别接续H17、H18、H20、H21和H22，其中安静承担的是心理状态的作用，并未直接把音乐的变化当成心理原因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"四条已经交代了从身体先行放松、重新承认在乎、容纳亲近与失去并存，到不舍重新引发急迫和疲惫的心理链条，即使拿掉具体的听感记录，仍能理解各阶段的内在因果及其连续性。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b9374ca3-f800-490f-9d9d-35aeb93c94f4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T145001504230Z", "elapsed_seconds": 234.906, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:53:56.436338+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "34d834894c0f26e8c4f22ad09df216d9b83e77f470a86cd8ee959deac2285616", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": fal